&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;POCs&lt;/strong&gt;: Build proof-of-concepts and sample implementations that showcase Browserbase&#39;s capabilities in customer-specific environments.&lt;/li&gt;
