&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Member&lt;/strong&gt;: Stay current on industry trends, competitive offerings, and emerging technologies in our space and help to train and enable the broader team on our product.&lt;/li&gt;
